senses.gloss:
1. नि-मातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be measured, &c.;
[the नि-मातव्य which occurs in Manu X. 94. is to
be referred to नि-मे, q. v.]

2. नि-मिष्, ट्, f., Ved. winking or twinkling of the
eye; shutting the eyes, falling asleep [cf. निमि];
अ-निमिष्, ट्, ट्, ट्, never closing or winking the eyes;
(ट्), m. a god; [cf. Nala V. 24.]
